From: Morgan Lee <morgan@hangs.example>
To: Tax preparation <tax@finance-demo.example>
Subject: HANGS FY2026 year end records and outstanding approvals
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 09:15:00 -0700
Message-ID: <HC-FY2026-0715@hangs.example>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary="===============0410856495446689697=="

--===============0410856495446689697==
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hello,

Attached are our year-end trial balance export, financial statement printouts=
 and draft partner information. The ledger is in the accounting folder.

The trial balance has not received final approval. The executed ownership agr=
eement and signed distribution authorization are still outstanding. Please re=
tain those questions for review.

Only one supporting invoice is included; the remaining detailed expense suppo=
rt has not been supplied.

Morgan Lee
HANGS Construction

